# Rust
/target
**/target
Cargo.lock.bak

# Score64 working data (content-addressed cache and rebuildable index)
.score64/

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

